<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en-GB">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>American Railtour Manager</title>
<style>
  :root{
    --Pullman-Green:#303B1B;        /* Pullman Car Co. Green */
    --br-blue-dk:#0c2740;
    --lms-maroon:#6e1f24;     /* LMS crimson lake */
    --gwr-green:#0f5132;
    --coach-cream:#f4ecd6;
    --warn:#e0a800;
    --danger:#a83232;
    --good:#2e7d32;
    --ink:#1b2430;
    --panel:#fbf7ee;
    --line:#d7cdb8;
    --shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.18);
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box}
  html,body{margin:0;padding:0}
  body{
    font-family:"Segoe UI",Tahoma,Verdana,sans-serif;
    background:#e7e1d3 url("data:image/svg+xml;utf8,<svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' width='40' height='40'><rect width='40' height='40' fill='%23e7e1d3'/><path d='M0 39 H40' stroke='%23d9d1c0' stroke-width='1'/></svg>");
    color:var(--ink);
    line-height:1.45;
  }
  header{
    background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--br-blue),var(--br-blue-dk));
    color:#fff;border-bottom:4px solid var(--warn);
  }
  .brand{
    display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;padding:12px 18px;max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;
    flex-wrap:wrap;
  }
  .roundel{
    width:46px;height:34px;flex:0 0 auto;position:relative;
  }
  .roundel::before{content:"";position:absolute;inset:14px 0;background:#fff;}
  .roundel::after{
    content:"";position:absolute;top:0;bottom:0;left:8px;width:6px;background:#fff;
    box-shadow:24px 0 0 #fff; transform:skewX(-18deg);
  }
  h1{font-size:1.35rem;margin:0;letter-spacing:.5px;font-weight:700}
  h1 small{display:block;font-size:.72rem;font-weight:400;opacity:.8;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase}
  .stats{margin-left:auto;display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}
  .stat{
    background:rgba(255,255,255,.1);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.25);
    border-radius:6px;padding:5px 11px;min-width:86px;text-align:center;
  }
  .stat b{display:block;font-size:1.02rem}
  .stat span{font-size:.62rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px;opacity:.8}
  .stat.cash b{color:#ffe9a8}
  nav{background:var(--br-blue-dk);border-bottom:3px solid var(--warn)}
  .tabs{max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap}
  .tabs button{
    background:none;border:none;color:#cdd8e6;padding:12px 18px;cursor:pointer;
    font-size:.82rem;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.4px;border-bottom:3px solid transparent;
    text-transform:uppercase;
  }
  .tabs button:hover{color:#fff;background:rgba(255,255,255,.06)}
  .tabs button.active{color:#fff;border-bottom-color:var(--warn);background:rgba(255,255,255,.09)}
  main{max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;padding:18px}
  .view{display:none;animation:fade .2s ease}
  .view.active{display:block}
  @keyframes fade{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(4px)}to{opacity:1}}
  h2{color:var(--br-blue);border-bottom:2px solid var(--line);padding-bottom:6px;margin-top:0;font-size:1.2rem}
  .lede{color:#4a545f;font-size:.9rem;margin-top:-4px}
  .grid{display:grid;gap:14px;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(280px,1fr))}
  .card{
    background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;
    box-shadow:var(--shadow);padding:14px;position:relative;
  }
  .card h3{margin:0 0 2px;font-size:1.02rem;color:var(--ink);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px}
  .badge{
    font-size:.6rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.6px;padding:2px 7px;border-radius:20px;
    color:#fff;font-weight:700;vertical-align:middle;
  }
  .b-steam{background:var(--lms-maroon)}
  .b-diesel{background:var(--br-blue)}
  .b-rake{background:var(--gwr-green)}
  .b-route{background:#7a4a12}
  .sub{color:#6a7480;font-size:.8rem;margin:0 0 8px;font-style:italic}
  .specs{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:8px 0;font-size:.82rem}
  .specs li{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding:2px 0;border-bottom:1px dashed #e4dcc8}
  .specs li span:last-child{font-weight:600}
  .price{font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--lms-maroon)}
  button.act{
    background:var(--br-blue);color:#fff;border:none;border-radius:6px;padding:9px 14px;
    cursor:pointer;font-weight:600;font-size:.85rem;width:100%;margin-top:6px;
  }
  button.act:hover{background:var(--br-blue-dk)}
  button.act:disabled{background:#9aa2ab;cursor:not-allowed}
  button.act.warnbtn{background:var(--lms-maroon)}
  button.act.warnbtn:hover{background:#521418}
  button.small{width:auto;padding:6px 12px;font-size:.78rem;margin:0}
  .bar{height:9px;border-radius:5px;background:#e2dac6;overflow:hidden;margin:3px 0 2px}
  .bar > i{display:block;height:100%;transition:width .3s}
  .cond-lbl{font-size:.72rem;color:#6a7480;display:flex;justify-content:space-between}
  .swatch{display:inline-block;width:14px;height:14px;border-radius:3px;border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.35);vertical-align:middle;margin-right:6px}
  .livery-line{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:2px;font-size:.82rem;margin:2px 0 6px;color:var(--ink)}
  .repaint{display:block;font-size:.75rem;color:#6a7480;margin:8px 0 2px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.4px}
  .repaint .mini{text-transform:none;letter-spacing:0}
  .repaint select{width:100%;margin-top:3px;padding:6px 8px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px;background:#fff;font-size:.82rem;color:var(--ink)}
  .empty{color:#8a94a0;font-style:italic;padding:24px;text-align:center;border:2px dashed var(--line);border-radius:8px}
  /* Run tour layout */
  .picker{display:grid;gap:14px;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr}
  @media(max-width:900px){.picker{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
  .picker h4{margin:0 0 8px;color:var(--br-blue);font-size:.9rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.5px}
  .opt{
    background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px;padding:9px 11px;cursor:pointer;
    margin-bottom:8px;font-size:.82rem;transition:.12s;
  }
  .opt:hover{border-color:var(--br-blue)}
  .opt.sel{border:2px solid var(--br-blue);background:#eef4fb}
  .opt.disabled{opacity:.45;cursor:not-allowed}
  .opt b{display:block}
  .opt .mini{color:#6a7480;font-size:.74rem}
  .projection{
    background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;padding:16px;margin-top:16px;box-shadow:var(--shadow);
  }
  .proj-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(120px,1fr));gap:10px;margin:10px 0}
  .proj-cell{text-align:center;background:var(--panel);border-radius:6px;padding:8px}
  .proj-cell b{display:block;font-size:1.15rem}
  .proj-cell span{font-size:.68rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.5px;color:#6a7480}
  .risk-lo{color:var(--good)} .risk-md{color:var(--warn)} .risk-hi{color:var(--danger)}
  .ledger{font-size:.8rem;max-height:260px;overflow:auto;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;background:var(--panel)}
  .ledger table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse}
  .ledger td{padding:6px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #eae1cd}
  .ledger td:last-child{text-align:right;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap}
  .pos{color:var(--good)} .neg{color:var(--danger)}
  /* modal */
  .modal-bg{
    display:none;position:fixed;inset:0;background:rgba(12,25,40,.65);z-index:50;
    align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:16px;
  }
  .modal-bg.show{display:flex}
  .modal{
    background:var(--coach-cream);border:3px solid var(--br-blue);border-radius:10px;max-width:560px;width:100%;
    max-height:90vh;overflow:auto;box-shadow:0 10px 40px rgba(0,0,0,.4);
  }
  .modal .head{background:var(--br-blue);color:#fff;padding:12px 18px;font-weight:700;font-size:1.05rem}
  .modal .body{padding:18px}
  .modal .body p{margin:.4rem 0;font-size:.9rem}
  .event{background:#fff;border-left:4px solid var(--warn);padding:8px 12px;margin:8px 0;font-size:.85rem;border-radius:0 6px 6px 0}
  .event.bad{border-left-color:var(--danger)}
  .event.good{border-left-color:var(--good)}
  .rep-tier{display:inline-block;padding:2px 9px;border-radius:20px;background:var(--gwr-green);color:#fff;font-size:.7rem;font-weight:700}
  .toolbar{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:10px 0 18px;align-items:center}
  .toolbar .season{background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px;padding:6px 12px;font-size:.82rem}
  footer{max-width:1200px;margin:10px auto 30px;padding:0 18px;color:#6a7480;font-size:.76rem;text-align:center}
  a{color:var(--br-blue)}
  .win-banner{background:var(--gwr-green);color:#fff;padding:10px 16px;border-radius:8px;margin-bottom:14px;font-weight:600}
  .busy-tag{background:#fbeecb;border:1px solid #e5c977;color:#7a5a12;font-size:.74rem;font-weight:600;border-radius:6px;padding:4px 8px;margin:2px 0 8px}
  .report-block.failed{background:#fbeaea;border:1px solid #e2b4b4;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;margin:-2px 0}
  .actionbar{
    position:sticky;top:0;z-index:20;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;
    background:var(--coach-cream);border:1px solid var(--line);border-left:5px solid var(--warn);
    border-radius:8px;padding:9px 14px;margin-bottom:14px;box-shadow:var(--shadow);
  }
  .actionbar #ab-info{font-size:.85rem;color:var(--ink)}
  .actionbar #ab-info b{color:var(--br-blue)}
  .actionbar button{margin-left:auto;width:auto;background:var(--gwr-green)}
  .actionbar button:hover{background:#0b3d26}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header>
  <div class="brand">
    <div class="roundel" title="British Rail"></div>
    <h1>American Railtour Manager<small>Charter Excursion Operator</small></h1>
    <div class="stats">
      <div class="stat cash"><b id="s-cash">—</b><span>Balance</span></div>
      <div class="stat"><b id="s-rep">—</b><span>Reputation</span></div>
      <div class="stat"><b id="s-fleet">—</b><span>Fleet</span></div>
      <div class="stat"><b id="s-week">—</b><span id="s-season">Season</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>
<nav>
  <div class="tabs">
    <button data-tab="depot" class="active">Depot</button>
    <button data-tab="power">Motive Power</button>
    <button data-tab="carriages">Carriages</button>
    <button data-tab="run">Run a Railtour</button>
    <button data-tab="works">Works &amp; Overhaul</button>
    <button data-tab="log">Ledger</button>
    <button data-tab="help">How to Play</button>
  </div>
</nav>

<main>
  <div class="actionbar">
    <div id="ab-info"></div>
    <button class="act" id="btn-advance">Advance One Week ▸</button>
  </div>
  <div id="winBanner"></div>

  <!-- DEPOT -->
  <section class="view active" id="v-depot">
    <h2>Your Depot</h2>
    <p class="lede">Your owned locomotives and carriage sets. Keep condition healthy — a failure on the road wrecks your reputation.</p>
    <h3 style="color:#6e1f24">Motive Power</h3>
    <div class="grid" id="depot-locos"></div>
    <h3 style="color:#0f5132;margin-top:22px">Carriage Sets</h3>
    <div class="grid" id="depot-rakes"></div>
  </section>

  <!-- MARKET: LOCOS -->
  <section class="view" id="v-power">
    <h2>Motive Power Market</h2>
    <p class="lede">Buy preserved steam locomotives and heritage diesels. Steam pulls the biggest crowds; diesels are reliable and cheaper to run.</p>
    <div class="grid" id="market-locos"></div>
  </section>

  <!-- MARKET: CARRIAGES -->
  <section class="view" id="v-carriages">
    <h2>Carriage Market</h2>
    <p class="lede">A locomotive is nothing without a rake. Bigger sets carry more fares; luxury Pullman stock commands premium tickets.</p>
    <div class="grid" id="market-rakes"></div>
  </section>

  <!-- RUN -->
  <section class="view" id="v-run">
    <h2>Plan a Railtour</h2>
    <p class="lede">Choose one locomotive, one carriage set and a route, then check the projection before you depart.</p>
    <div class="picker">
      <div><h4>1 · Locomotive</h4><div id="pick-loco"></div></div>
      <div><h4>2 · Carriage Set</h4><div id="pick-rake"></div></div>
      <div><h4>3 · Route</h4><div id="pick-route"></div></div>
    </div>
    <div id="projection"></div>
  </section>

  <!-- WORKS -->
  <section class="view" id="v-works">
    <h2>Works &amp; Overhaul</h2>
    <p class="lede">Send tired locomotives and rakes to the works to restore condition. A full overhaul costs more but returns them to as-new.</p>
    <div class="grid" id="works-list"></div>
  </section>

  <!-- LOG -->
  <section class="view" id="v-log">
    <h2>Company Ledger</h2>
    <p class="lede">Every transaction, tour and mishap, most recent first.</p>
    <div class="ledger"><table id="ledger-body"></table></div>
  </section>

  <!-- HELP -->
  <section class="view" id="v-help">
    <h2>How to Play</h2>
    <div class="card" style="max-width:760px">
      <p>You run a British charter railtour company. Buy <b>motive power</b> (steam locos and heritage diesels) and <b>carriage sets</b>, then run <b>railtours</b> over the great scenic lines of Britain to turn a profit and build your reputation.</p>
      <ul style="font-size:.9rem">
        <li><b>Dispatching a tour ties up its locomotive and carriage set</b> for the length of the run (1–3 weeks, longer for longer routes). They can't run again until they return. Press <b>Advance One Week</b> (top of every screen) to pass the time — so a bigger fleet lets you keep several tours on the road at once.</li>
        <li><b>You only find out how a tour went when the train returns.</b> The result — the takings, the reputation swing, and whether the loco failed en route — is revealed when it's back in the yard, not when you dispatch it.</li>
        <li><b>Reputation</b> drives demand and ticket prices. Full, reliable, scenic tours build it; breakdowns and half-empty trains destroy it.</li>
        <li><b>Condition</b> falls every tour — harder on steam and on steeply-graded routes. Overhaul at the <b>Works</b> before a loco gets unreliable.</li>
        <li><b>Haulage:</b> if a rake has more coaches than a loco can comfortably haul, you'll pay for an assisting loco and risk failure — match power to load.</li>
        <li><b>Steam-favoured routes</b> reward steam haulage with a bigger crowd; the enthusiasts turn out for the classics.</li>
        <li><b>Liveries:</b> repaint any locomotive in the Depot. Iconic liveries give a small public-draw bonus — the crowds love a favourite.</li>
        <li><b>Season</b> shifts demand — summer is boom time, winter is lean (bar the festive Santa specials).</li>
        <li><b>Goal:</b> reach a company net worth of <b>£1,000,000</b> to be named <i>Railtour Operator of the Year</i>. Let the balance stay negative into a new week and you're in receivership.</li>
      </ul>
      <div class="toolbar">
        <button class="act small warnbtn" id="btn-newgame">Start a New Company</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>

<footer>
  UK Railtour Manager · a self-contained browser tycoon · progress auto-saves in your browser ·
  routes and rolling stock inspired by real British railtour operations.
</footer>

<div class="modal-bg" id="modalBg">
  <div class="modal">
    <div class="head" id="modalHead">Railtour Report</div>
    <div class="body" id="modalBody"></div>
    <div class="body" style="padding-top:0"><button class="act" id="modalClose">Continue</button></div>
  </div>
</div>

